# Ubuntu for Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro — $release_name

Ubuntu 26.04 LTS GNOME with Linux $kernel_release for Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro (`piano`, SM8750P), alongside Android.
This directory was assembled and checked on the host. **Full fresh-install acceptance of these exact images is pending**; component device results below come from earlier tests on the same tablet. No device was accessed, no tag created and nothing pushed by this release task.

Follow `docs/INSTALL.md` or `docs/INSTALL.zh-CN.md` in the integration checkout at the commit below. Installation erases Android data. Use only stock `$stock_build` on slot A, preserve your backup and recovery set, and charge in Android. Verify every file with `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS` before use. This is a local release directory; no downloadable archive parts are claimed.

